pure states (Bloch): X+ (Fraction(1, 1), Fraction(0, 1), Fraction(0, 1)), X- (Fraction(-1, 1), Fraction(0, 1), Fraction(0, 1)), Y+ (Fraction(0, 1), Fraction(1, 1), Fraction(0, 1)), Y- (Fraction(0, 1), Fraction(-1, 1), Fraction(0, 1)), Z+ (Fraction(0, 1), Fraction(0, 1), Fraction(1, 1)), Z- (Fraction(0, 1), Fraction(0, 1), Fraction(-1, 1))
